# device-gateway environment configuration template — placeholder only.
# No real secrets. `src/broker_config.py` reads this via `os.environ` directly (this deployable
# has no dotenv/`.env`-file loader, unlike the Business API's pydantic-settings config) — for
# local dev, export these into your shell before running `python -m src.gateway`, e.g.:
#   set -a; . .env; set +a   (bash)   or   Get-Content .env | ... (PowerShell — see README)

# --- Event Broker (Redis Streams, ADR-0008/ADR-0010) — must point at the SAME Redis instance as
# --- the Business API's own RAAD_BROKER__URL/RAAD_REDIS__URL (backend/.env.example) so both
# --- deployables share the one `raad:events` stream. Local dev: docker/docker-compose.yml's
# --- `redis` service (ADR-0012).
# DEVICE_GATEWAY_BROKER_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
